{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Generic animal/alien creature factory, one to eight original creatures per batch. stage=plan quotes concept + Meshy 3D + anatomy vision without paid calls. stage=build requires explicit budget and stable idempotency_key, then generates private meshes and inspectable skeleton overlays. Poll gripforge_generation_read; inspect each preview/profile before stage=rig with generation_job, creature_id, reviewed_anatomy=true and optional corrected profile. Reuses the anatomy-aware Blender rig, never humanoid autorig. Exports GLB, Blender source and diagnostics. Procedural starting clips are drafts; missing fly/swim/action clips are reported. No automatic game-ready approval. Existing owned immutable source/concept revisions can be reused. Use generation_cancel/retry for durable work.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"allow_rerig":{"type":"boolean"},"budget":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"credits":{"maximum":100000,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"usd":{"maximum":10000,"minimum":0,"type":"number"}},"type":"object"},"concept_provider":{"default":"openai","enum":["openai","xai"],"type":"string"},"creature_id":{"pattern":"^[a-z][a-z0-9_-]{0,39}$","type":"string"},"generation_job":{"pattern":"^gen_[A-Za-z0-9_-]{8,64}$","type":"string"},"idempotency_key":{"pattern":"^[a-zA-Z0-9_.:-]{8,160}$","type":"string"},"profile":{"additionalProperties":{},"propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"type":"object"},"recipes":{"description":"One to eight distinct creatures; each variant needs its own id and prompt. Required for plan/build.","items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"concept":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"assetId":{"pattern":"^lib_[A-Za-z0-9_-]{8,64}$","type":"string"},"fileRole":{"maxLength":100,"type":"string"},"revisionId":{"maxLength":100,"